/// An implementation of `shapes::sides` for `circles::Ellipse` declared
/// outside the module that declares `Ellipse`, which `open_functions.mdl`
/// proves dispatch never finds. It would win if it were found, since the
/// only other candidate for an ellipse is the default.
#smdl

import .::circles::*;

@(pure)
export int sides(const &circles::Ellipse this [[anno::unused()]]) = 99;
